    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d161-a1">

                <pb facs="0403" n="377" sameAs="frus:frus1902app1/pg377"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Annex A.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Treasury Department, Office of the Secretary</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1886-04-21"><hi rendition="#italic">April 21,
                                1886</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to Department letter of this
                    date, directing you to proceed with the revenue steamer <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bear</hi>, under your command, to the seal islands, etc., you are hereby
                        <pb facs="0404" n="378" xml:id="pg378"/> clothed with full power to enforce
                    the law contained in the provisions of section 1956 of the United States Revised
                    Statutes, and directed to seize all vessels and arrest and deliver to the proper
                    authorities any or all persons whom you may detect violating the law referred
                    to, after due notice shall have been given.</p>
                <p>You will also seize any liquors or firearms attempted to be introduced into the
                    country without proper permit, under the provisions of section 1955 of the
                    Revised Statutes, and the proclamation of the President dated 4<hi
                        rendition="#superscript">th</hi> February, 1870.</p>
                <p>Respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer>(Signed) <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">C. S. Fairchild</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Captain <hi rendition="#small-caps">M. A. Healy</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Commanding Revenue Steamer Bear, San Francisco,
                            California.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
